sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Operator
    participant A as Agent (skill)
    participant C as leadforge CLI
    participant G as scraper engine
    participant W as Business websites
    participant D as SQLite

    U->>A: "find me leads" (+ intake answers)
    A->>C: leadforge doctor --fix --json
    C-->>A: digest: ok (engine installed)
    A->>C: leadforge intake --answers answers.yaml
    C-->>A: digest: icp.yaml written
    A->>C: leadforge run --icp icp.yaml
    C->>G: scrape listings (conservative pacing)
    G-->>C: listings
    C->>D: normalize + upsert (dedupe by place_id)
    loop each business website (polite, capped)
        C->>W: GET home/about/team/contact
        W-->>C: HTML
        C->>D: contacts + people candidates + evidence
    end
    C-->>A: digest: stage=dm_pending (42 to label)
    A->>C: leadforge dm export --max 60
    C-->>A: small NDJSON of snippets
    A->>A: label decision makers in ONE pass
    A->>C: leadforge dm apply
    A->>C: leadforge run --resume
    C->>C: score + export
    C-->>A: digest: exported (142 leads, sheet path)
    A-->>U: summary + where the sheet is
